ovement, not including its number.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"movementTitle"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The identification metadata for the score, such as creators, rights, source, and relation information.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"identification"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The score-wide defaults for scaling, layout, and default font and language values.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"defaults"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The credits — such as title, composer, and copyright notices — that appear on the first or following pages of the score.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"credit"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The list of parts that make up the score, along with the part-group elements that indicate braces and brackets between them.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"partList"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The parts that make up the score, in the same order as they appear in the part list.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"parts"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Initializer","title":"init(version:work:movementNumber:movementTitle:identification:defaults:credit:partList:parts:)","symbolKind":"init","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"version","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDocumentV","text":"MXLDocument","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDocumentV7VersionV","text":"Version","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"work","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLWorkV","text":"MXLWork","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"movementNumber","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"type